title: Rebuilding a District
subtitle: One district has lost many of its members.
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and sys_rebuild_timer <= 0 and sys_any_loss = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.sys_rebuild_timer = 4;
Q.month_actions += 1;
RG.target('loss');
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Rebuilding a District

The party in **[+ sys_target_name +]** has [+ sys_target_members +] thousand members left, where there used to be many more. The district office is open two evenings a week, in the back room of a pub. [? if sys_target_repression >= 60 : The police are the main reason. ?][? if sys_target_repression < 60 : Defeats, quarrels and unemployment have done the rest. ?]

- @organisers: Visit every member who stopped paying.
- @gates: Recruit at the factory gates.
- @hall: Buy the old brewery hall for the district.
- @easy_discard

@organisers
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Lapsed members come back, and the district looks to Berlin.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {members: 0.12, loyalty: 6});
Q['lean_' + Q.leading_faction] += 1;
!}

Three organisers from Berlin rent rooms in [+ sys_target_name +] and visit every member who has stopped paying dues. Many start again.

@gates
subtitle: Young workers join, and the district gets angrier.
choose-if: sys_target_militancy >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: The workers of [+ sys_target_name +] are in no mood to join anything.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {members: 0.07, militancy: 3});
!}

At every shift change, our people are at the gates with leaflets and membership cards. The young workers sign.

@hall
subtitle: Costs 2 funds. A home of its own, with a canteen and a cellar. The district holds together.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: We need 2 funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {members: 0.08, loyalty: 12});
RG.news('Communists open a party house in ' + Q.sys_target_name);
!}

The hall gets a red flag on the roof, a library in the gallery and a canteen where a meal costs half what it costs in town. On Saturday nights there are dances.
